{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21956","headline":"问友 · 白居易","name":"问友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种兰不种艾，兰生艾亦生。\n根荄相交长，茎叶相附荣。\n香茎与臭叶，日夜俱长大。\n锄艾恐伤兰，溉兰恐滋艾。\n兰亦未能溉，艾亦未能除。\n沈吟意不决，问君合何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21956.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21956","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}